OL,3,GNEWSAPolice live facial recognition
OL,4,Aplans 'postponed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has postponed plans to
OL,7,Fintroduce live facial recognition (LFR)
OL,8,Fcameras in a city centre.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police had planned to
OL,11,Fintroduce the cameras in Bath for a day
OL,12,Fon 25 November as a way of identifying
OL,13,Fpeople that were on pre-authorised
OL,14,Fwatchlists.
OL,16,FThe force has now announced it is
OL,17,Fpostponing the plans "following
OL,18,Ffeedback from elected representatives
OL,19,Fand local stakeholders," including
OL,20,Flocal MP, Wera Hobhouse, who has
OL,21,Fwelcomed the announcement.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
